    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizdoc-List Energy Usage Meters-v3-spec",
    "description": "The Energy Usage Meters API provides access to a detailed list of energy usage meters within a given system. This API allows users to retrieve essential information about each meter, including identification, location, and usage statistics. It primarily serves energy management professionals, utilities, and facility managers looking to monitor and analyze energy consumption trends efficiently. By utilizing this API, developers can integrate meter usage data into their applications, enhance reporting capabilities, and support data-driven decision-making.",
